olor":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2026-08-14T15:19:08Z","updated_at":"2026-08-31T07:31:01Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nI managed to discover this bug in godot 4.7.1, specifically the steam build.\nI'm not sure if it occurs on other versions.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.1.stable  (a13da4feb) - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9174) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-10400F CPU @ 2.90GHz (12 threads) - 15.91 GiB memory - WASAPI (192000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThis is the issue:\n\n<img width=\"99\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8802684d-4f6d-420b-a150-a57867b45548\" />\n(I snipping tool'd the bug so i can give a more focused view on it.)\nIt yes effected the other tscn thumbnails for the other scenes in my game.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Make a new project.\n2. Make a new scene and save it to res:// (any subdir. But i'm not sure if that will effect reproduction since I haven't tested it with saving the scene to a subfolder.)\n3. Go to your project settings and go to Application > Run\n4. Click on the white file icon with the 3 dots on it.\n5. The tscn file's thumbnail is random coloured pixels (mine were pink and a few other colours, although I suspect it is due to the thumbnail renderer trying to interpret the data of the tscn file as an image, even though its text!)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nI don't have an MRP. sorry.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122416/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122416/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}